    "pearls": [
      "The most common sites, in order, are the abdominal aorta, the coronary arteries, the popliteal arteries and the carotid arteries.",
      "Foam cells, lipid-laden macrophages, are the first sign of atherosclerosis, in the fatty streak.",
      "Plaques with a thin fibrous cap and a large lipid core are the ones that rupture."
